    <label>fiery plumes I</label>
    <description>Feathers born of fire: flames hurt less, and at ancestral purity not at all. The Vermilion Bird shed her feathers over the south, and the families that picked them up never feared a hearth again.</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/CVG/Gene_FieryPlumes</iconPath>
    <iconColor>(0.7, 0.7, 0.7)</iconColor>
    <displayOrderInCategory>81</displayOrderInCategory>
    <biostatCpx>1</biostatCpx>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_BloodGene_FieryPlumes</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <damageFactors>
      <Flame>0.75</Flame>
      <Burn>0.75</Burn>
